# Inputs to trust-venv.requirements.txt: the trust-owner venv's third-party
# runtime dependencies, as RANGES, identical to pyproject.toml's entries for the
# same packages (tests/test_trust_venv_preflight.py fails if they drift or if
# the pinned versions stop satisfying them). Transitive dependencies (cffi,
# pycparser) are resolved into the .txt. Do not edit the .txt by hand:
# regenerate it (INSTALL.md, "Regenerating the hash-pinned files") and review
# the diff -- a hash is what root and the trust owner will run.
